sequenceDiagram
    participant KServe as KServe Inference Logger
    participant MMAgent as ModelMesh Agent
    participant HealthApp as Health App<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant Storage as Storage Backend<br/>PVC (HDF5) / MariaDB
    participant Scheduler as Prometheus Scheduler<br/>asyncio (30s)
    participant PrometheusReg as Prometheus Registry<br/>(in-memory gauges)
    participant MetricsEP as /q/metrics<br/>8081/TCP HTTP
    participant KRBP as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>(sidecar)
    participant MainApp as Main App (API)<br/>8081/TCP HTTP
    participant User as User / Dashboard
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus Server

    Note over KServe, Storage: Flow 1: KServe CloudEvent Ingestion
    KServe->>HealthApp: POST / (CloudEvent)<br/>HTTP/8080, No Auth
    HealthApp->>Storage: Store inference payload
    Storage-->>HealthApp: ACK

    Note over MMAgent, Storage: Flow 2: ModelMesh Agent Ingestion
    MMAgent->>HealthApp: POST /consumer/kserve/v2<br/>HTTP/8080, No Auth, gzip
    HealthApp->>HealthApp: Decompress gzip body
    HealthApp->>Storage: Store flattened payload
    Storage-->>HealthApp: ACK

    Note over Scheduler, Prometheus: Flow 3: Scheduled Metric Computation
    loop Every 30s (configurable)
        Scheduler->>Storage: Read inference data<br/>(per registered model)
        Storage-->>Scheduler: Inference datasets
        Scheduler->>Scheduler: Compute drift/fairness metrics<br/>(KS, JSD, MMD, SPD, DIR...)
        Scheduler->>PrometheusReg: Update Prometheus gauges
    end
    Prometheus->>KRBP: GET /q/metrics<br/>via Service port
    KRBP->>MetricsEP: Forward to 127.0.0.1:8081
    MetricsEP->>PrometheusReg: Collect gauges
    PrometheusReg-->>MetricsEP: Gauge values
    MetricsEP-->>KRBP: Prometheus text format
    KRBP-->>Prometheus: Metrics response

    Note over User, Storage: Flow 4: On-Demand Metric Request
    User->>KRBP: POST /metrics/drift/kstest<br/>HTTPS, OAuth Bearer
    KRBP->>KRBP: Validate Bearer token
    KRBP->>MainApp: Forward to 127.0.0.1:8081<br/>HTTP (loopback)
    MainApp->>Storage: Read data, compute metric
    Storage-->>MainApp: Inference data
    MainApp->>MainApp: Compute requested metric
    MainApp-->>KRBP: JSON result
    KRBP-->>User: Metric result
